<body><main><nav aria-label="Site navigation"><a href="../">riegulate / portfolio</a><a href="./">Creative Studio OS</a><a href="privacy/">Privacy policy</a></nav><p class="tag">Personal software / 01</p><h1>Creative Studio OS.</h1><p>A private desktop application built for the independent creative practice of Rieg Rodig (Riegulate). It organizes music, games, visual references, audiovisual projects, tasks and creative production on the owner's computer.</p><h2>Pinterest integration</h2><p>The proposed integration is a read-only personal reference viewer. After approval and authorization, it will let the owner browse selected boards and saved Pins in his own account for visual research and artistic direction, and open their original sources.</p><p>The connection is not yet active. The planned integration will retrieve content on demand rather than maintain a persistent Pinterest dataset. It will not publish Pins, access other accounts, manage advertising or automate engagement.</p><h2>Creative tools and AI</h2><p>The wider application includes optional AI-assisted planning and creative tools. These are separate from the proposed Pinterest viewer. Pinterest API information will not be supplied to AI providers, used to train or improve models, or retained in AI memory without express permission from Pinterest and appropriate authorization.</p><h2>Access</h2><p>This is a single-owner local application, not a public SaaS service. This website provides information and the privacy policy; it does not expose the application, its local files or its dashboard.</p><p><a href="privacy/">Read the privacy policy</a></p><p class="muted">Independent application. Not affiliated with or endorsed by Pinterest.</p><footer>Riegulate · Independent creative practice · João Pessoa, Brazil<br/><a href="mailto:riegulate@gmail.com">riegulate@gmail.com</a></footer></main></body></html>